%% Lab 002 — Evaluation flow with precedence DENY > STEP_UP > CONFIRM > ALLOW
flowchart TD
    A[Action request] --> B[Identity]
    B --> C[Delegation chain]
    C --> D[APE]
    D --> E[APSE]
    E --> F[Scope limits context]
    F --> G[Collect candidate outcomes]
    G --> H{Precedence}
    H -->|most restrictive| I[DENY]
    H -->|else| J[STEP_UP]
    H -->|else| K[CONFIRM]
    H -->|all pass| L[ALLOW]
    I --> M[Audit + fallback]
    J --> M
    K --> M
    L --> M
    M --> N[execution: not_performed]
